## 🗺️ Application Flow (5 Steps)

```
Step 1: Enter WhatsApp Number
        ↓
        Phone exists in MongoDB?
        YES → skip OTP → pre-fill donor form
        NO  → SMS OTP via MessageWall → verify → empty form
        ↓
Step 2: Donor Details
        Name (First / Middle / Last)
        Gender, Email, DOB, Wedding Date
        Address + GPS (auto-filled via Nominatim)
        Profile photo (webcam or avatar)
        Profession: Work → Designation | Student → Institution
        ↓
Step 3: Seva Details
        Seva Name (from MongoDB seva collection)
        Seva Type: One Time | Regular
        Donation Amount (default pre-filled, editable)
        Transaction ID (optional — for GPay / bank transfer)
        Auto-generated Receipt:  JGN-YYYYMMDD-XXXX
        ↓
Step 4: Seva Person Details
        Name, Gotra, Birthstar (Nakshatra), Zodiac (Rashi)
        Seva Date: English calendar OR Hindu calendar
          Hindu → auto-converts to Gregorian via ephem library
        Family members / relations (optional, unlimited)
        ↓
Step 5: Receipt & Confirmation
        Printable receipt with all details
        AI-generated Seva Blessing Card (Pollinations.ai, free)
        Email confirmation sent to donor (SMTP)
        WhatsApp confirmation via co3.live API
```

---

## 🗃️ MongoDB Collections

| Collection | Purpose | Key Indexes |
|---|---|---|
| `counters` | Auto-increment ID tracker | `_id` (collection name) |
| `users` | Admin / staff login accounts | `username` unique, `email` unique |
| `user_roles` | Custom role labels | `role_name` unique |
| `zodiac` | 12 Rashi signs | `zodiac_order` |
| `birthstar` | 27 Nakshatras | `zodiac_id + star_order` |
| `gotra` | Gotra list | `gotra_name` unique |
| `donors` | Donor master | `whatsapp_number` unique, `email` unique |
| `seva` | Seva master list | `seva_name` unique |
| `seva_donations` | Each seva booking | `receipt_no` unique, `donor_id`, `seva_id` |
| `seva_persons` | Seva person per booking | `seva_donation_id` unique |
| `seva_person_relations` | Family members | `seva_person_id` |
| `purnima_names` | 13 Purnima months | `name` unique, `display_order` |
| `amavasya_names` | 13 Amavasya months | `name` unique, `display_order` |
| `krishna_paksha_tithis` | 14 waning-moon tithis | `tithi_name` unique |
| `shukla_paksha_tithis` | 14 waxing-moon tithis | `tithi_name` unique |
| `faqs` | FAQ content | `order`, `_id` |

