## 📡 API Endpoints

### 🔐 Auth

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|---|---|---|
| GET | `/auth/setup-status` | Check if first admin exists |
| POST | `/auth/setup/send-phone-otp` | Send SMS OTP for first-time admin setup |
| POST | `/auth/setup/verify-phone-otp` | Verify SMS OTP |
| POST | `/auth/admin-setup` | Create first Administrator (one-time only) |
| POST | `/auth/login` | Login — returns user info + is_admin flag |
| POST | `/auth/signup` | Normal user self-registration |
| POST | `/auth/forgot-password` | Send reset OTP to admin email |
| POST | `/auth/forgot-password/verify` | Verify reset OTP |
| POST | `/auth/forgot-password/set-password` | Set new password |

