## 🧾 Receipt Number Format

**Pattern:** `JGN-YYYYMMDD-XXXX`

| Part | Example | Meaning |
|---|---|---|
| `JGN` | `JGN` | Jagannath temple prefix |
| `YYYYMMDD` | `20260501` | Booking date |
| `XXXX` | `3742` | 4-digit random code |

**Example:** `JGN-20260501-3742`

Uniqueness enforced by MongoDB unique index on `seva_donations.receipt_no`.

