## 🐛 Common Issues

| Problem | Solution |
|---|---|
| `ServerSelectionTimeoutError` | MongoDB is not running — start it with `net start MongoDB` (Windows) or `sudo systemctl start mongod` (Linux) |
| `DuplicateKeyError` on startup | `create_indexes()` is idempotent — this is fine; indexes already exist |
| OTP not received (email) | Check `SMTP_PASSWORD` is a Gmail **App Password**, not your account password |
| OTP not received (SMS) | Verify `MESSAGEWALL_API_KEY`, `SENDER_ID`, and `TEMPLATE_ID` are correct |
| `ModuleNotFoundError` | Activate venv first: `venv\Scripts\activate` (Windows) or `source venv/bin/activate` (Linux/Mac) |
| Port 8000 already in use | Use a different port: `uvicorn main:app --reload --port 8001` |
| Docker: data lost on restart | Always mount a named volume: `-v temple_data:/data/db` |

